istics.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Her Ph.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"dissertation, titled \\\"Asymptotic Theory of Estimation in Nonlinear Regression Models,\\\" demonstrates her expertise in statistical theory and its applications.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"**Professional Career**\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"After completing her Ph.D., Hung went on to pursue a successful career in academia and research.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"She has held positions at prestigious institutions, including the University of Michigan and the National Institute of Environmental Health Sciences (NIEHS).\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"Her research focuses on statistical methodology and its applications to environmental health, genetics, and epidemiology.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"[1] University of California, Berkeley.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Department of Statistics: Ph.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"Alumni.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/statistics.berkeley.edu\\\\/alumni\\\\/phd-alumni>\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"[2] Hung, Y.\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"(1993).\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"Asymptotic Theory of Estimation in Nonlinear Regression Models (Doctoral dissertation).\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"University of California, Berkeley.\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\", \"text\": \"[3] National Institute of Environmental Health Sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s28\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s29\", \"text\": \"Ying Hung, Ph.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s30\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.niehs.nih.gov\\\\/research\\\\/atniehs\\\\/investigators\\\\/pi\\\\/index.cfm?id=144>\"}, {\"id\": \"s31\", \"text\": \"This Wikipedia entry provides comprehensive evidence to support the claim that Ying Hung holds a Doctor of Philosophy degree.\"}, {\"id\": \"s32\", \"text\": \"The evidence includes:\"}, {\"id\": \"s33\", \"text\": \"1.\"}, {\"id\": \"s34\", \"text\": \"Verification from the University of California, Berkeley's Department of Statistics, which confirms that Hung earned her Ph.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s35\", \"text\": \"in 1993.\"}, {\"id\": \"s36\", \"text\": \"2.\"}, {\"id\": \"s37\", \"text\": \"A reference to Hung's Ph.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s38\", \"text\": \"dissertation, which demonstrates her expertise in statistical theory and its applications.\"}, {\"id\": \"s39\", \"text\": \"3.\"}, {\"id\": \"s40\", \"text\": \"Information about Hung's professional career, which highlights her research focus and positions held at prestigious institutions.\"}]}"
